difference, is, a slot name

[reconciliation], has the view, [source]
    if [reconciliation], is, a reconciliation
    and [reconciliation], has the golden view, [source]
[reconciliation], has the view, [source]
    if [reconciliation], is, a reconciliation
    and [reconciliation], checks, [source]

[source], has the key part, [part]
    if [source], gives the key part, [part], [any column]

[row], is left out of, [reconciliation]
    if [reconciliation], has the golden view, [source]
    and [row], is a row of, [source]
    and [reconciliation], does not cover the golden rows with, [column], [value]
    and [row], has the cell, [column], [value]

[row], is covered by, [reconciliation]
    if [reconciliation], is, a reconciliation
    and [reconciliation], has the golden view, [source]
    and [row], is a row of, [source]
    and [row], is, an event
    and not [row], is left out of, [reconciliation]

[row], is in time with, [other row], in, [reconciliation]
    if [reconciliation], allows a time difference of, [tolerance]
    and [reconciliation], has the golden view, [source]
    and [reconciliation], checks, [other source]
    and [row], is a row of, [source]
    and [other row], is a row of, [other source]
    and [row], happened at, [time]
    and [other row], happened at, [other time]
    and [difference], is the difference of, [other time], [time]
    and [difference], is at most, [tolerance]
    and [other difference], is the difference of, [time], [other time]
    and [other difference], is at most, [tolerance]

[row], agrees with, [other row], on, [part], in, [reconciliation]
    if [reconciliation], has the golden view, [source]
    and [reconciliation], checks, [other source]
    and [source], gives the key part, [part], [column]
    and [other source], gives the key part, [part], [other column]
    and [row], is a row of, [source]
    and [row], has the cell, [column], [value]
    and [other row], is a row of, [other source]
    and [other row], has the cell, [other column], [value]

[row], disagrees with, [other row], on, [part], in, [reconciliation]
    if [row], is in time with, [other row], in, [reconciliation]
    and [reconciliation], has the view, [source]
    and [source], has the key part, [part]
    and not [row], agrees with, [other row], on, [part], in, [reconciliation]

[row], is paired with, [other row], in, [reconciliation]
    if [row], is covered by, [reconciliation]
    and [row], is in time with, [other row], in, [reconciliation]
    and not [row], disagrees with, [other row], on, [any part], in, [reconciliation]

[row], matches, [other row]
    if [row], is paired with, [other row], in, [any reconciliation]

[row], is matched in, [reconciliation]
