[row], is matched in, [reconciliation]
    if [any row], is paired with, [row], in, [reconciliation]

[row], is lost in, [reconciliation]
    if [row], is covered by, [reconciliation]
    and not [row], is matched in, [reconciliation]

[row], is followed by a match in, [reconciliation]
